# D3-C3f 对照：手动 raise LLMCallError 可被 try/except 捕获
# 期望: 手动 raise 的 LLMCallError 被捕获（证明 try/except 对 LLMCallError 本身有效，
#   缺陷限定在"provider 层失败投递路径"）

# expect-class: PASS
# expect-out: caught=manual fail | DONE
# expect-exit: 0
# expect-llm: false
try:
    raise LLMCallError("manual fail", "", "provider")
except LLMCallError as e:
    print("caught=" + e.message)
except LLMError as e:
    print("caught_llm=" + e.message)
print("DONE")
